{"id":"68b1723359ce7492","group":"93","path":"93/93-lem-substitution-identity.md","title":"Substitution Identity","display":"Substitution Identity","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-lem-substitution-identity","aliases":["93-lem-substitution-identity"],"display":"Substitution Identity","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-substitution]]","[[93-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-lem-substitution-identity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-lem-substitution-identity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Substitution Identity"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8e602c19b2984096\" href=\"?note=8e602c19b2984096\" title=\"93-df-substitution\">93-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-substitution-identity---Substitution-Identity\">lem-substitution-identity - Substitution Identity</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\)</span> is a similarity type, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in T_{\\tau}(X)\">\\(\\varphi\\in T_{\\tau}(X)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\\)</span> is the sourced similarity-type predicate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IdSub}_{93}(X)\">\\(\\operatorname{IdSub}_{93}(X)\\)</span> is the identity-substitution graph defined here, and its hat is the sourced unique homomorphic extension.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}\\)</span> is the exact substitution predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8e602c19b2984096\" href=\"?note=8e602c19b2984096\" title=\"93-df-substitution\">93-df-substitution</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}identity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{IdSub}_{93}(X)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}identity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{IdSub}_{93}(X)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\operatorname{IdSub}_{93}(X);\\tau,X)\n\\land\\varphi\\in T_{\\tau}(X)\n\\to\\widehat{\\operatorname{IdSub}_{93}(X)}^{\\tau}(\\varphi)=\\varphi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\operatorname{IdSub}_{93}(X);\\tau,X)\n\\land\\varphi\\in T_{\\tau}(X)\n\\to\\widehat{\\operatorname{IdSub}_{93}(X)}^{\\tau}(\\varphi)=\\varphi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The identity substitution fixes every formula.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-substitution-identity---Substitution-Identity","text":"lem-substitution-identity - Substitution Identity","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"8e602c19b2984096","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"c2ca1af9af149e69","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"8e602c19b2984096","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}$ is the exact substitution predicate of [[93-df-substitution]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in T_{\\tau}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IdSub}_{93}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}identity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{IdSub}_{93}(X)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in X\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\operatorname{IdSub}_{93}(X);\\tau,X)\n\\land\\varphi\\in T_{\\tau}(X)\n\\to\\widehat{\\operatorname{IdSub}_{93}(X)}^{\\tau}(\\varphi)=\\varphi.","display":true}],"bytes":1229,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["8e602c19b2984096","c2ca1af9af149e69"]}